        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Tier 0 sees TASK.md and your tests. It picks a model per task — Sonnet for most things, Opus when the spec is gnarly, Haiku for plumbing. The runner writes code, runs the tests, eats the failures, tries again. It is allowed to fail. It is not allowed to decide what to ship."
          }
