        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Tier 1 is Claude in review mode, fresh context, no access to the runner's prior turns. The runner produces a patch; Claude reads the diff against the spec, flags drift, asks for revisions in a tone that does not negotiate. Only when the review passes does the patch land on an agent/ branch."
          }
        ],
